                "text": "Republicans would rather shut down the government than protect the Affordable Care Act. A shutdown puts ACA tax credits at risk\u2014and in Texas, premiums could jump 289%, costing families $459 more each year. They passed up multiple chances to extend them in the Big Beautiful Bill; they chose not to. Families shouldn't have to pay the price for their political games.",
