                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "They told us to trust them on groceries, housing, and childcare\u2014but they\u2019re constantly putting Americans last.\n\nNow they\u2019ve shut down the government and put healthcare on the chopping block.\n\nIn Texas alone, 1.6 million people could lose coverage. Families are staring down premiums that could jump by $20,000 a year, hospitals could close, and everyone\u2019s costs will go up.\n\nDemocrats have been at work waiting on Republicans to finally show up and clean up the mess they made.",
