                "text": "Let\u2019s be clear\u2026the Big Ugly bill is why your insurance premiums keep going up.\n\nMarjorie Taylor Greene voted for it.\n\nWhile the wealthy got permanent tax cuts, working families got higher bills and less coverage. Now that it\u2019s become personal, folks\u2019 eyes are starting to open.\n\nBut we weren\u2019t sent to Congress to only care when it hits home \u2014 we were sent here to fight for every single constituent we represent.",
